{"displayStem":"한 갈비사이공간의 층 관계를 단순화한 모식도다. 위쪽이 몸 바깥이다. X로 표시한 구조와 근육층의 관계를 읽는다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 모식도 · 크기 비례 아님","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C01 c01-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"구조 관계를 단순화한 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"470\" fill=\"white\"></rect><text x=\"80\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">몸 바깥</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"85\" width=\"140\" height=\"65\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"560\" y=\"85\" width=\"140\" height=\"65\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></rect><text x=\"105\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">갈비뼈</text><text x=\"575\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">갈비뼈</text><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"330\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"12\"></line><text x=\"270\" y=\"177\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">바깥갈비사이근</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"237\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">속갈비사이근</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"317\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">가장속갈비사이근</text><ellipse cx=\"195\" cy=\"285\" rx=\"13\" ry=\"13\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><text x=\"218\" y=\"295\" font-size=\"25\" style=\"font-size:25px\" fill=\"#111\">X</text><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"375\" x2=\"700\" y2=\"375\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"></line><text x=\"270\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">벽측가슴막</text></svg></div></div>"]}